            <note corresp="#d50-f3" n="3" xml:id="d50-f3-content">
                <p>A report on the Ninth SEATO Council session,
                    April 13–15, which reflects in more detail this optimistic view of the meeting,
                    is in circular airgram CA–11512, May 6. (Department of State, Central Files, DEF
                    4 SEATO)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
